OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy overnight with outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain or showers, some of which could
OL,8,Fbe heavy at times. Likely becoming
OL,9,Fdrier towards the south and west of
OL,10,Fthe region by dawn. Less cold than
OL,11,Flast night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA cloudy start and mostly dry,
OL,14,Falbeit for some light rain at first
OL,15,Ffor the northeast of the region. Cloud
OL,16,Ftending to break with some sunny
OL,17,Fspells by the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
