OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FOften
OL,6,Fcloudy with a chance of occasional
OL,7,Frain or showers on Tuesday and
OL,8,FWednesday, but also some drier
OL,9,Fperiods, especially later on Thursday.
OL,10,FTemperatures generally near normal.
